loading Fibonacci LED

ld target/ARM/microchip/samd21.mu4
ld target/ARM/processor/cortex-m0-plus.mu4

flash

0 vector-table flash-vectors ( the bootloader on this chip will happily point the vector table at our origin)
flash-vectors

ld! target/ARM/v6-m/kernel-itc.mu4
ld! target/ARM/fibled.mu4
ld! target/ARM/v6-m/cold.mu4
